  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds. Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and a good pinch of salt. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, combine everything garnish (see ingredients) and panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 1cm-thick pieces. Dip Japanese tofu steaks into the flour mixture to coat, then into the egg and finally into the breadcrumb mixture. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12361fda05b1d5f95f00-401aad0f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook crumbed tofu in batches until golden and cooked through, 2-4 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the tofu does not stick to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12361fda05b1d5f95f00-ab0b9ac0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil.\n• Add deluxe salad mix, mixed salad leaves, apple and cucumber. Toss to combine and season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• In a small bowl, combine ponzu and mayonnaise. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12361fda05b1d5f95f00-dbb29a66.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls.\n• Top with Japanese-style crumbed tofu.\n• Drizzle over creamy ponzu dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12361fda05b1d5f95f00-80012475.jpeg"
    }
  ]
